I am enjoying to play remotely on a public server called NAO. All you
really need is a telnet client to open a terminal session. What I do
is, in a shell/console window type in one of the following commands...

   telnet 64.71.163.206

   telnet nethack.alt.org

There you can play our favourite game in a colored text version.
Beyond playing on NAO you will find interesting features described
here...

   http://www.alt.org/nethack/

